T1  - P03-280 - Differences in quality of life between groups of patients with schizophrenia
T2  - European Psychiatry
A1  - Mas-Expósito L
A1  - Gómez-Benito J
A1  - Amador-Campos J A
A1  - Lalucat-Jo L
KW  - eppi-reviewer
