T1  - Leveraging social capital: multilevel stigma, associated HIV vulnerabilities, and social resilience strategies among transgender women in Lima, Peru
JF  - JOURNAL OF THE INTERNATIONAL AIDS SOCIETY
A1  - Perez-Brumer AG
A1  - Reisner SL
A1  - McLean SA
