AB  - Recovery processes of 32 women were explored in six focus groups following completion of treatment in a community based women-specific substance abuse group program. Grounded theory analysis yielded an over-arching theme of Building a House of Recovery and several sub-themes describing women's perceptions of the processes that were central to their recovery.
