T1  - Mental Health and Psychosocial Problems and Needs of Violence Survivors in the Colombian Pacific Coast: A Qualitative Study in Buenaventura and Quibdo
JF  - PREHOSPITAL AND DISASTER MEDICINE
A1  - Santaella-Tenorio J
A1  - Bonilla-Escobar FJ
A1  - Nieto-Gil L
