T1  - "Losing the tombola": a case study describing the use of community consultation in designing the study protocol for a randomised controlled trial of a mental health intervention in two conflict-affected regions
JF  - BMC MEDICAL ETHICS
A1  - Shanks L
A1  - Moroni C
