T1  - An aerobic walking programme versus muscle strengthening programme for chronic low back pain: a randomized controlled trial
JF  - CLINICAL REHABILITATION
A1  - Shnayderman I
A1  - Katz-Leurer M
KW  - eppi-reviewer
PY  - 2013
DA  - 2013///
