AB  - Describes an off-site day treatment program for over 300 nursing home residents from 22 separate skilled or intermediate nursing facilities. The program is multifaceted, encompassing community contact, group and individual treatment, and creative art therapies. Two case illustrations describe how an innovative treatment approach can begin to meet the mental health needs of nursing home residents. (PsycInfo Database Record (c) 2020 APA, all rights reserved)
