T1  - Long-term effects of rent supplements and mental health support services on housing and health outcomes of homeless adults with mental illness: extension study of the At Home/Chez Soi randomised controlled trial
JF  - LANCET PSYCHIATRY
A1  - Stergiopoulos V
A1  - Mejia-Lancheros C
A1  - Nisenbaum R
