AB  - The herbal anti-drug medication HEANTOS 4 is a Vietnamese traditional medication, used for treatment of drug addiction. It was composed and prepared first by Mr. Tran Khuong Dan in early 1990 ' s as a water extract. Since 1995 the Institute of Chemistry which belongs to Vietnam Academy of Science and Technology (VAST) has cooperated with Dan ' s group for further scientific developments of HEANTOS. Since then, the product Heantos 4 has been developed as hard capsules through the improvement of extraction method, composition of ingredients etc. Heantos 4 is standardized applying the updated technologies, e.g. the finger print HPLC/MS, TLC, the spectral analysis like IR, NMR spectra. During almost 20 years of research on Heantos, the Institute of Chemistry has cooperated with several international institutions and persons in the clarification of toxicology, the chemistry and mechanism of action as well as in the clinical studies of Heantos e.g. the UNDP/UNOPS; Institute of Plant Biochemistry, Halle/S., Germany; University of Essen, Germany; University of British Columbia (UBC), Vancouver, Canada. In 1996 the UNDP supported this medication with a project named: "Further scientific development of the anti-drug medication Heantos" (VIE 96/033). About 200 compounds have been isolated and identified from this medication. None of them was assigned as toxic for food and pharmaceutical products (BMBF-projeet: BNBest.-BMBF-98, Germany). A clinical study in phase II on Heantos 4 was introduced in Essen University, Germany in 2003-2005. Study on the mechanism of action of Heantos 4 is now carrying out in the University of British Columbia (UBC), Vancouver, Canada, under the guidance of Dr. Anthony Phillips and Dr.Michael Krausz. The clinical study with phase I, II, III carried out by the Central Psychiatric Hospital Nr. 1, Thuong Tin, Hanoi, Vietnam under supervision of the Ministry of Health has finalized in the year 2011 with good results. In 2012 the Vietnamese Drug Administration issued the permission for production and utilization of Heantos 4. Heantos 4 is produced as hard capsules of 0,500 gram/capsule by Ha Thanh pharmaceutical company, Tuu Liet Road, Thanh Tri district, Hanoi Vietnam in cooperation with the Heantos Joint Stock Company (Heantos JSC.). One dose of Heantos 4 (for one detoxification) includes 70 capsules, used within 5-7 days. The use of Heantos 4 in many drug addiction treatment centers in Vietnam showed, that Heantos 4 is effective, cheap, helps patients to overcome withdrawal symptoms mildly. No unwanted side effects have been observed, Heantos 4 is easy to be used. It can be well used for treatment of drug addiction in the communities and families. Study on the revicidism in Hoa Binh treatment center, Vietnam showed, that 90-95% patients remained drug-clean after 3 months following the detoxification during the follow-up in the families and communities. Heantos 4 is now being used in most of treatment centers for drug addicts in Vietnam.
