T1  - Beyond bruises and broken bones: The joint effects of stress and injuries on battered women's health
JF  - AMERICAN JOURNAL OF COMMUNITY PSYCHOLOGY
A1  - Sutherland CA
A1  - Bybee DI
A1  - Sullivan CM
KW  - eppi-reviewer
PY  - 2002
DA  - 2002///
